{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>南非發生兩宗嚴重槍擊案，17人死亡。</p><p></p><p>其中一宗發生在行政首都比勒陀利亞市郊，警方稱當地周日深夜在一間棚屋發現9名遭槍殺的人。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SA.SHOOTING-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260NFUfCcIsW1794838599.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>另一宗發生東部夸祖盧－納塔爾省，警方周日晚接到報，發現一輛滿布彈孔的七人汽車，內有8具男性屍體，均有多處槍傷。</p><p></p><p>南非槍支暴力經常發生，每年發生約20萬至30萬宗涉槍罪案，平均每日有60人死於謀殺。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:39:08.567628+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T13:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T23:58:33.558121+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T14:32:33.050420+00:00","content_hash":"8b2595bf356e4945012a90152c115b09dd15dbf25fd089e6a2e6c42f66d49e32","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:39:08.567628+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}